  "title": {
    "text": "Job churn fell while people kept moving between regions",
    "subtitle": [
      "UK, index 2012 = 100. Job reallocation rate (2012: 30.8%) and longer-distance migration rate, moves in + out between English regions and nations (2012: 4.7% of population).",
